<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/8/msa@/~cl_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/8/msa@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/8/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/8/msa@/~cl_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/8/msa@> .
